Machine Learning
Congratulations on completing all three courses of the Machine
Learning Specialization! You studied modern machine learning
concepts, including supervised learning (linear regression, logistic
regression, neural networks, decision trees), unsupervised learning
(clustering, anomaly detection), recommender systems, and
reinforcement learning. You learned some of the best practices for
building machine learning models. You’ve also gained practical skills
to apply machine learning techniques to challenging real-world
problems. Now #BreakIntoAI and start building your career in
machine learning!
